# Student Study Planner and Progress Tracker

A complete student study management web application built using PHP, MySQL, Bootstrap 5, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.

## Features
- Student registration and login/logout
- Dashboard with progress overview
- Subject and topic management
- Study planner with schedule tracking
- Task management with filters
- Progress tracker with completion bars
- Weekly timetable
- Goals tracking
- Notes management
- Exam and assignment reminders
- Responsive UI for desktop, tablet and mobile

