## Requirements
- XAMPP / WAMP / MAMP
- PHP 8.2+
- MySQL
- Browser (Chrome/Firefox/Edge)

## Setup Instructions using XAMPP
1. Install XAMPP and start Apache and MySQL.
2. Copy the project folder into `htdocs`.
3. Open `phpMyAdmin` at `http://localhost/phpmyadmin`.
4. Create the database `student_study_planner`.
5. Import the SQL file from `sql/database.sql`.
6. Open your browser and visit `http://localhost/student-study-planner`.

## Database Connection
Open `config/database.php` and verify:
```php
define('DB_HOST', 'localhost');
define('DB_USER', 'root');
define('DB_PASS', '');
define('DB_NAME', 'student_study_planner');
```
If your MySQL username/password differs, change them accordingly.

## Default Login
After registering a student account, use the registered email and password to log in.

## Notes
- Use prepared SQL statements.
- Sessions are used for authentication.
- Each user can access only their own records.

